<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_holybolt.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Holy Paladins in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-holy-paladin-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Holy Paladin gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Holy Paladin drops found in Phase 5 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Holy Paladins guide</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Holy Paladin</h3>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 5, and should be effective for both the <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=85804/selfless-healer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_gaurdedbythelight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Selfless Healer</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=114163/eternal-flame">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_torch_thrown.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eternal Flame</span></a> playstyles, though this example is set up for the former. Consult the Stat Priority Guide as well as the Gemming section below for more information on how to optimize reforging and item enhancements for Eternal Flame. Also of note is the Wrist item <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96408/armplates-of-the-vanquished-abomination">
<img alt="Armplates of the Vanquished Abomination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidpaladin_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armplates of the Vanquished Abomination</span></a> which can drop with various secondary stats; on paper Mastery is best for Selfless Healer, and Critical Strike is better for Eternal Flame, though in practice Mastery is generally superior for both specs due to the overhealing inherent to Critical Strikes.<br/>
<br/>
